                        <li>Fixed a bug where the Big Picture in-game overlay could be abnormally pixelated for titles using the Vulkan graphics API</li>
                        <li>Fixed mouse cursor intermittently disappearing while mousing over certain windows (e.g. full-screen videos) which caused mouse input to not work in the overlay until restarted</li>
